# slug: ch66-materialize
# source: chapters/ch66.tex:154
# label: alg:ch66-materialize
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch66.tex:157
# caption: Materialize a finite virtual-object graph while preserving identity.

REQUIRE well-formed recipes with stable object IDs and valid field references
ENSURE concrete objects with the recipe graph's sharing and cycles
FORALL virtual object IDs v DO
  allocate an uninitialized shell and record it as the image of v
END FOR
FORALL virtual object IDs v DO
  FORALL fields in the recipe for v DO
    write the constant value or already allocated referenced shell
  END FOR
END FOR
expose the completed objects to the recovered frame

